{"seq":2,"slug":"cloth-self-collision","title":"布料碰撞与自碰撞：让褶皱不穿模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/cloth-soft-body-simulation/cloth/cloth-self-collision","wordCount":1509,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"布料碰撞与自碰撞-让褶皱不穿模\">布料碰撞与自碰撞：让褶皱不穿模</h1><p>让布动起来不难，难的是让它别穿过别的东西、更别穿过自己。披风要贴着角色背部而不是插进去，裙摆叠起的褶皱不能互相穿插，落在桌上的桌布要堆成自然的堆而不是糊成一片。碰撞处理的计算量常常超过布料模拟本身——一块 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个顶点的布，朴素的自碰撞检测是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，几千个顶点就足以拖垮一帧。本篇讲怎么把碰撞接进 <a href=\"position-based-dynamics\">PBD</a> 循环，并用空间加速把自碰撞压到可实时。碰撞约束的求解仍走<a href=\"../foundations/constraints-stability\">约束与稳定性</a>那套投影，本篇聚焦碰撞<strong>检测</strong>与<strong>响应建模</strong>，不重复约束求解的通用机制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>布料碰撞分两大类，难度天差地别。<strong>外部碰撞</strong>：布和场景里的其它物体（角色、地面、家具）碰，对方通常用简化的碰撞代理（胶囊、球、凸包）表示，检测是「点 vs 简单形状」，相对便宜。<strong>自碰撞</strong>：布和自己碰，每个顶点/三角形都可能撞上同一块布的任意其它部分，是布料里最贵的计算。两者都要解决「检测穿透」和「响应推开」两件事，但自碰撞还多一层麻烦：布是无限薄的，必须人为赋予厚度，否则两层布会卡在彼此正中间无法分开。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[布料碰撞] --&gt; B[外部碰撞]&#10;  A --&gt; C[自碰撞]&#10;  B --&gt; D[点 vs 碰撞代理&lt;br/&gt;胶囊/球/凸包]&#10;  C --&gt; E[顶点-三角形 VT]&#10;  C --&gt; F[边-边 EE]&#10;  E --&gt; G[需空间加速&lt;br/&gt;BVH/网格哈希]&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; H[厚度模型&lt;br/&gt;避免两层卡死]&#10;  D --&gt; I[生成碰撞约束]&#10;  H --&gt; I&#10;  I --&gt; J[投影进 PBD 循环]\">graph TD\n  A[布料碰撞] --&gt; B[外部碰撞]\n  A --&gt; C[自碰撞]\n  B --&gt; D[点 vs 碰撞代理&lt;br/&gt;胶囊/球/凸包]\n  C --&gt; E[顶点-三角形 VT]\n  C --&gt; F[边-边 EE]\n  E --&gt; G[需空间加速&lt;br/&gt;BVH/网格哈希]\n  F --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; H[厚度模型&lt;br/&gt;避免两层卡死]\n  D --&gt; I[生成碰撞约束]\n  H --&gt; I\n  I --&gt; J[投影进 PBD 循环]</pre><p>下表是碰撞处理里几个核心抉择：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>抉择</th>\n<th>选项 A</th>\n<th>选项 B</th>\n<th>取舍</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>检测时机</td>\n<td>离散（DCD，只查终点）</td>\n<td>连续（CCD，查整段运动）</td>\n<td>DCD 快但会隧穿；CCD 贵但不漏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自碰撞图元</td>\n<td>顶点-三角形</td>\n<td>边-边</td>\n<td>两者都要，单用任一会漏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间结构</td>\n<td>网格哈希</td>\n<td>BVH 层次包围盒</td>\n<td>哈希适合均匀分布；BVH 适合不均匀</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>响应方式</td>\n<td>罚力</td>\n<td>约束投影</td>\n<td>PBD 里统一用约束投影</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"隧穿问题-为什么需要连续碰撞检测\">隧穿问题：为什么需要连续碰撞检测</h2><p>最朴素的离散碰撞检测（DCD）只在每帧末检查顶点是否在障碍物<strong>内部</strong>。问题是：一个快速运动的顶点可能在一帧内从障碍物的一侧「瞬移」到另一侧，两端都在外部，DCD 完全察觉不到——这就是隧穿（tunneling）。薄布高速运动时尤其严重，披风一甩就穿过了角色。</p>\n<p>连续碰撞检测（CCD）解决这个问题：它不查终点位置，而是查顶点从起点到终点这段<strong>线段</strong>有没有在某个时刻穿过三角形。这归结为求解一个三次方程（顶点和三角形顶点都在线性运动时，共面时刻是三次多项式的根），找到最早碰撞时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t \\in [0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6542em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>。CCD 的数学和<a href=\"../../game-physics/collision-detection/continuous-detection\">游戏物理</a>里刚体的连续碰撞同源，但布料要对<strong>每条边、每个顶点-三角形对</strong>都做，量大得多。工程上常用「DCD 为主 + 对高速顶点启用 CCD」的混合策略来平衡成本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"空间加速-把-o-n-压下来\">空间加速：把 O(N²) 压下来</h2><p>自碰撞的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是不可接受的。两种主流加速结构把它降到接近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<p><strong>网格哈希（spatial hashing）</strong>：把空间切成均匀格子，每个顶点按坐标哈希进对应格子，只检测同格及相邻格内的图元对。格子边长通常取布料厚度的数倍。优点是构建和查询都极快、易于 GPU 并行；缺点是布料褶皱时局部密度极不均匀，某些格子会塞满顶点退化成局部 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p><strong>BVH（包围盒层次）</strong>：给布料三角形建一棵 AABB 树，自碰撞检测就是树和自己求交，自顶向下剪枝。优点是自适应非均匀分布；缺点是布料每帧变形，BVH 要重建或重拟合（refit），refit 比重建便宜但树质量会退化。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[N 个顶点/三角形] --&gt; B{分布是否均匀?}&#10;  B --&gt;|相对均匀,GPU| C[网格哈希&lt;br/&gt;O N 构建,易并行]&#10;  B --&gt;|高度不均匀| D[BVH 层次包围盒&lt;br/&gt;自适应剪枝]&#10;  C --&gt; E[只查同格+邻格]&#10;  D --&gt; F[树与自身求交&lt;br/&gt;每帧 refit]&#10;  E --&gt; G[候选图元对]&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; H[精确 VT/EE 测试]\">flowchart TD\n  A[N 个顶点/三角形] --&gt; B{分布是否均匀?}\n  B --&gt;|相对均匀,GPU| C[网格哈希&lt;br/&gt;O N 构建,易并行]\n  B --&gt;|高度不均匀| D[BVH 层次包围盒&lt;br/&gt;自适应剪枝]\n  C --&gt; E[只查同格+邻格]\n  D --&gt; F[树与自身求交&lt;br/&gt;每帧 refit]\n  E --&gt; G[候选图元对]\n  F --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; H[精确 VT/EE 测试]</pre><h2 id=\"厚度与响应-让两层布分得开\">厚度与响应：让两层布分得开</h2><p>布是数学上无限薄的曲面，但物理上的布有厚度。如果不建模厚度，两层布会精确卡在彼此的零厚度平面上，约束求解器无法判断该往哪边推。解法是给布料赋一个虚拟厚度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span>：当两个图元的最近距离小于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 时就视为碰撞，生成一个把它们推到距离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ge h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 的约束。对顶点-三角形对，约束形如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mrow><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>n</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = (\\vec{x}_{vertex} - \\vec{x}_{closest})\\cdot \\hat{n} - h \\ge 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oses</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>，这是一个不等式约束，只在违反（穿透）时激活，激活后就和距离约束一样走<a href=\"../foundations/constraints-stability\">投影</a>。</p>\n<p>响应里还有两个常被忽略的细节。<strong>摩擦</strong>：碰撞后顶点不能只沿法向推开，还要按库仑摩擦衰减切向速度，否则布会在斜面上无摩擦地滑下去——摩擦模型和<a href=\"../../game-physics/collision-response/friction-model\">游戏物理</a>的库仑模型一脉相承。<strong>排斥力 vs 硬约束的平衡</strong>：纯硬约束在密集褶皱里容易抖动，常配一个柔和的排斥（repulsion）项做预防性推开，硬约束只在排斥失败时兜底，这是 Bridson 经典布料碰撞框架的核心思想。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>布料碰撞分外部碰撞（点 vs 简单代理，便宜）和自碰撞（布 vs 自己，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，最贵）两类。</li>\n<li>离散检测会隧穿，高速薄布必须用连续碰撞检测（CCD，解三次方程求最早碰撞时刻），工程上常用 DCD+CCD 混合。</li>\n<li>网格哈希（均匀、易并行）和 BVH（自适应、需每帧 refit）把自碰撞从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 压到接近线性。</li>\n<li>必须给布赋虚拟厚度避免两层卡死；响应要含摩擦，并常用「柔和排斥 + 硬约束兜底」防止密集褶皱抖动。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>碰撞约束走的投影机制 → <a href=\"../foundations/constraints-stability\">约束与稳定性</a></li>\n<li>碰撞约束接入的主循环 → <a href=\"position-based-dynamics\">基于位置的动力学 PBD</a></li>\n<li>自碰撞是性能大头，怎么省 → <a href=\"../practice/lod-performance\">LOD 与性能</a></li>\n<li>连续碰撞检测的刚体同源版本 → <a href=\"../../game-physics/collision-detection/continuous-detection\">游戏物理 · 连续碰撞检测</a></li>\n<li>摩擦模型的来源 → <a href=\"../../game-physics/collision-response/friction-model\">游戏物理 · 摩擦模型</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"布料碰撞与自碰撞：让褶皱不穿模","id":"布料碰撞与自碰撞-让褶皱不穿模"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"隧穿问题：为什么需要连续碰撞检测","id":"隧穿问题-为什么需要连续碰撞检测"},{"level":2,"text":"空间加速：把 O(N²) 压下来","id":"空间加速-把-o-n-压下来"},{"level":2,"text":"厚度与响应：让两层布分得开","id":"厚度与响应-让两层布分得开"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"基于位置的动力学 PBD：现代布料的工业标准","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/cloth-soft-body-simulation/cloth/position-based-dynamics"},"next":{"title":"弯曲与剪切约束：决定布料手感的两类约束","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/cloth-soft-body-simulation/cloth/bending-shearing"}}